	<ThingDef ParentName="Seg_GG_MeleePowerWeapon_base">
		<defName>Seg_GG_PlagueScythe</defName>
		<label>plague scythe</label>
		<description>The scythe cuts so life may thrive.\n\nThis is a daemonic weapon resembling a twisted agricultural implement, infused with so much rot and disease that the barest scratch is enough to bestow the blessings of the Grandfather - or to bring death. Nurgle's followers are fond of the ancient Terran imagery connecting peasant reapers with death and doom, and carry such weapons into battle to reap their own harvest of souls for the Plague God. Those whose bloodstream is flooded with Nurgle's rot may even rise again as plaguebearers when their bodies are consumed by decay.</description>
